  "reasoning": "The defendant forcibly entered the victim's home, stripped the victim, performed sexual assault (including forced oral insertion) and also beat the victim causing rib fractures and a light injury. The conduct matches the statutory offense of forced indecency/insult to women (强制猥亵、侮辱妇女). Additionally, the beating that resulted in a legally recognized light injury satisfies the elements of intentional injury (故意伤害). Therefore both charges apply.",
